{"title":"spectral veils, sagitarrius iii","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/spectral-veils-sagitarrius-iii","date":1766026320000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/beb80d16-d254-4805-9252-66b30955d70b/sag+iii.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p><em>this series is created for my collaboration with </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>LJ of Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, based of the 36 decans of the astrological year. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong>Sagitarrius III</strong> — December 12-21<br /><strong>Key themes from LJ</strong> — overexposure, doubles, the numinous<br /><strong>Before this: </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/neon-glow-comfort-sagitarrius-ii\" target=\"_blank\">neon glow comfort, sag II</a><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/dosing-the-poison-cure-scorpio-ii\"><br /></a><br />*</p><p>I drew Sagitarrius III while laying horizontal on the couch in the last days before leaving Istanbul, when I felt like 1000 pounds with the weight of everything — past, present, future - and I could barely get out of bed, let alone pack and leave my life behind. after I finally departed, the next day, I woke up to overcast skies in Paris and decided to go to the cemetery for a walk. there was a silence there that felt centuries old, and very much Sagitarrius III. I felt the presence of the <em>numinous</em> — a tether to the otherworldly, to the divine, to some world beyond this one, hidden behind a series of veils. </p><p><br />that weekend, I wandered through Paris during zombie weather, and, as it got dark, I danced a lot of tango. tango would seem like the opposite of this decan. it is hot, sticky, sweaty, bloody. but, it also felt like a tether to the numinous. I dance in pursuit of transcendence. </p><p>I’m writing this from NYC now. I still feel it: the presence of veils that separate this world from all the others. this life — from all the others I haven’t lived, and will never live. <br /></p><p>this illustration came strangely effortlessly. I imagined laying down in a winter forest and looking up at the ghostly pine trees and a white winter sun, as if post-apocalyptic. I felt alive and dead at the same time; mortal and immortal at once. <br /></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/aa56202a-ae59-4b78-affc-0b14db129bfb/sag_iii-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>explore</strong> <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\